[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5403.59, "timestamp": "01:30:03", "text": "连100日元的硬币都没有。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5407.189, "timestamp": "01:30:07", "text": "现在身上没有100日元的硬币。什么都没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5410.149, "timestamp": "01:30:10", "text": "。我身无分文，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5423.11, "timestamp": "01:30:23", "text": "所以，在光线充足的地方，这感觉还不错。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5425.11, "timestamp": "01:30:25", "text": "啊。是啊。是啊。我们要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5428.709, "timestamp": "01:30:28", "text": "瀑布区。那地方不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5431.27, "timestamp": "01:30:31", "text": "如果我没记错的话，那里光线不太好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5433.03, "timestamp": "01:30:33", "text": "但是个可以坐下来休息的好地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5446.79, "timestamp": "01:30:46", "text": "我不知道有没有办法打开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5449.11, "timestamp": "01:30:49", "text": "防抖之类的功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5452.31, "timestamp": "01:30:52", "text": "。哦，食物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5454.07, "timestamp": "01:30:54", "text": "掉下来了。"}]